<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="opr36-dao-catalogue" name="DAO Union" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="5"><sharedRules><rule id="opr36-dao-00001" name="Targeting Visor" hidden="false"><description>When shooting at enemies over 9&quot; away, this model gets +1 to hit rolls.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-00002" name="Ambush Beacon" hidden="false"><description>Friendly units using Ambush may ignore distance restrictions from enemies if they are deployed within 6&quot; of this model.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-00003" name="Crossing Strike" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, when this model moves through enemy units, pick one of them and attack it with this weapon as if it was shooting. This weapon may only be used in this way.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-00004" name="Enhanced Precision Marksman" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Precision Marksman, it always gets +1 to hit rolls from Precision Marksman (instead of only when shooting over 9&quot; away).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-00005" name="Enhanced Targeting Visor" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Targeting Visor, it always gets +1 to hit rolls from Targeting Visor (instead of only when shooting over 9&quot; away).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-00006" name="Evasive" hidden="false"><description>Enemies get -1 to hit rolls when attacking units where most models have this rule.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-00007" name="Fortified" hidden="false"><description>When units where most models have this rule take hits, those hits count as having AP(-1), to a min. of AP(0).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-00008" name="Good Shot" hidden="false"><description>This model gets +1 to hit rolls when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-00009" name="Hit &amp; Run" hidden="false"><description>Once per round, this model may move by up to 3&quot; after shooting or being in melee.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000a" name="Hit &amp; Run Shooter" hidden="false"><description>Once per round, this model may move by up to 3&quot; after shooting.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000b" name="Melee Shrouding" hidden="false"><description>When a unit where most models have this rule is targeted by an enemy unit for charging, that enemy unit gets -2&quot; range to a min. of 6&quot;.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000c" name="Piercing Shooting Mark" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which friendly units gets AP(+1) on their weapons when shooting against once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000d" name="Precise" hidden="false"><description>Gets +1 to hit when attacking.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000e" name="Precision Marksman" hidden="false"><description>When shooting at enemies over 9&quot; away, this model gets +1 to hit rolls.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000f" name="Precision Spotter" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 30&quot; and in line of sight of this model and roll one die, on a 4+ place a token on it. Friendly units may remove tokens from their target before rolling to hit to get +X to hit rolls when attacking, where X is the number of removed tokens.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000g" name="Puncture" hidden="false"><description>Ignores Regeneration, and when attacking units where most models have Defense 2+ to Defense 3+, this weapon gets AP(+2).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000h" name="Ranged Slayer" hidden="false"><description>When using Hold actions and shooting, this model's weapons get AP(+2) if most models in the target have Tough(3) or higher.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000i" name="Slayer" hidden="false"><description>When using Hold actions and shooting, or when charging, this model's weapons get AP(+2) if most models in the target have Tough(3) or higher.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000j" name="Counter in Melee Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Counter on its weapons in melee.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000k" name="Enhanced Targeting Visor Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Enhanced Targeting Visor.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000l" name="Fortified Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Fortified.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000m" name="Hit &amp; Run Shooter Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Hit &amp; Run Shooter.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000n" name="Increased Shooting Range Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get +6&quot; range on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000o" name="Melee Shrouding Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Melee Shrouding.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000p" name="Ranged Slayer Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Ranged Slayer.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000q" name="Stealth Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Stealth.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000r" name="Aura of Peace (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one friendly unit within 12&quot;, which gets Fearless once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000s" name="Killing Blow (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy model within 18&quot; in line of sight, which takes 2 hits with AP(1). This effect is resolved as if the target was a unit of [1].</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000t" name="Coordinated Aggression (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to two enemy units within 18&quot; in line of sight, which friendly units gets AP(1) on their weapons when shooting against once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000u" name="Devastating Strike (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 12&quot; in line of sight, which takes 4 hits with Puncture.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000v" name="Psychic Stabilization (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to three friendly units within 18&quot;, which get Enhanced Targeting Visor once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0000w" name="Deadly Surge (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 12&quot;, which takes 9 hits with Bane.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-0001m" name="Armor(2)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 2+.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-dao-000tq" name="Anti-Cover" hidden="false"><description>When attacking with this weapon, ignore the target's cover protection.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="opr-spellcat-dao-entry" name="Spell Catalogue" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="opr36-dao-001kz" name="Spell Catalogue" targetId="opr-spell-catalogue-category" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><infoLinks><infoLink id="opr36-dao-001l0" name="Aura of Peace (1)" targetId="opr36-dao-0000r" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dao-001l1" name="Killing Blow (1)" targetId="opr36-dao-0000s" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dao-001l2" name="Coordinated Aggression (2)" targetId="opr36-dao-0000t" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dao-001l3" name="Devastating Strike (2)" targetId="opr36-dao-0000u" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dao-001l4" name="Psychic Stabilization (3)" targetId="opr36-dao-0000v" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dao-001l5" name="Deadly Surge (3)" targetId="opr36-dao-0000w" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><constraints><constraint id="opr36-dao-001l6" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/><constraint id="opr36-dao-001l7" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="opr36-dao-0004a" name="Battle Suit Elite" type="unit" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="opr36-dao-00046" name="Heroes" targetId="b174-c09d-3660-f041" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><profiles><profile id="opr36-dao-00047" name="Battle Suit Elite" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f010" typeName="Unit" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Quality" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f011">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Defense" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f012">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f013">Hero, Targeting Visor, Tough(6)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="opr36-dao-00048" name="Hero" targetId="opr-core-hero" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="opr36-dao-00049" name="Targeting Visor" targetId="opr36-dao-00001" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="opr36-dao-00045" name="Model 1" type="model" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="opr36-dao-00043" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="opr36-dao-00044" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="opr36-dao-0001x" name="Replace Dual Suit-Flamers" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="opr36-dao-0001n"><constraints><constraint id="opr36-dao-0001y" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="o